# archive for the shirt and the vest (event.cpp ExePacket_SetParts). Scene functions made for the shirt hide model
# info 2 (with info 6) in some cuts: r10bs20/s21/s22 (the lake, the rope), r20bs00 (cuts 0xD and 0xE), r227s00/s01/s02
# (the castle's QTE), r317s00 (the knife fight, cut 0). With the cheat where his rule gives the shirt or the vest
# (runtime/cheats.cpp re4_cheat_leon_jacket_events: also a stand-in in Leon's costume), that hid the jacket's front
# and collar: the jacket showed only its sleeves. Those hides are skipped then. Without the cheat, before the r106
# event (his rule gives the jacket anyway), Normal and Special, the extra games: as the game.
